  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The supplementary appeal targets three million Afghans and 1.2 million host community members in Pakistan. with this funding, UNFPA will strengthen health facilities, map Gender Based Violence response services, and conduct awareness sessions on SRH and Gender Based Violence.</narrative>
